         n        nnz    CPU us/call  GPU-kernel us   GPU-rtrip us   GFLOP/s(CPU)    speedup
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
       200       2007           1.35         143.16         211.77          2.982      0.01x
      1000      10018           5.02         165.58         235.46          3.989      0.03x
      5000      49998        5899.91         251.55         332.65          0.017     23.45x
     10000      99996          11.45         414.51         502.70         17.469      0.03x
